        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Maya Thompson\n- Songs: \"Ronan\"\n- Tours: The 1989 World Tour\n- Events: Stand Up to Cancer, Glendale, Arizona stop\n\nFacts:\n- In September 2012, Taylor Swift first performed the song \"Ronan\" live for Stand Up to Cancer.\n- The 1989 World Tour was the fourth concert tour by American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift.\n- The 1989 World Tour supported Taylor Swift's fifth studio album, \"1989\" (2014).\n- Taylor Swift has performed \"Ronan\" publicly only one other time, at the Glendale, Arizona stop of The 1989 World Tour.\n- Maya Thompson attended the Glendale, Arizona performance of \"Ronan\" on The 1989 World Tour.",
